# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repository and on checkout, on every
# platform. Notes, skills and generated context blocks are parsed as text and
# compared byte-for-byte in tests; a CRLF checkout would fail on Windows and
# nowhere else, which is the worst kind of failure to debug.
* text=auto eol=lf

